               08 Ashok (packlist.lv_chapter pkg variable is populated in packlist_generator routine instead of package main body.
               09 Ashok (scr 20753 - populate_packlist_tables -> cursor pack_hdr modified )
               10 Ashok 01/21/2015 - IM 10342 - populate_packlist_tables -> cursor pack_hdr modified.
               11 Kishore (06/29/2015) - Display debug messages based on value in the DEBUG_CONTROLS table.
